{
  "name": "Mendwell",
  "category": "Landing pages",
  "kind": "template",
  "summary": "A family clinic website with a sliding six-step booking flow, live free slots and a symptom guide",
  "about": "A nine-page website for a family clinic with GP, dental, children's and physio care, in soft teal and white with a warm coral accent. Booking is a six-step stepper whose cards slide sideways, and the time grid shows free slots filling and emptying live while your pick is held for ten minutes. Services, doctor profiles, a body-map symptom guide, insurance cover and prices, FAQ, a drawn map with hours, and a My visits area all work.",
  "how": [
    "Open a page from the pill menu: Services, Doctors, Symptom guide, Prices & insurance, FAQ or Contact",
    "Press Book a visit and go through service, clinician, day, time, details and confirm; the cards slide sideways",
    "Watch the time grid: taken times fill in and freed ones flash coral; your chosen time is held for ten minutes",
    "Tap the body map in the symptom guide, pick symptoms, how long and how bad, and book the suggested visit",
    "Choose an insurer and plan on the prices page to see your cover and what each visit costs you",
    "Open a doctor's profile to book one of their next free times, or save them to your care team",
    "Manage visits and family in My visits; press Ctrl+K to search, and reset the demo data there"
  ],
